DESCRIPTION >
    Bookkeeping for ingest.py: last stored date per eod symbol and FX pair, and the last successful
    fetch per (dataset, symbol) from fetch_log. dataset 'fetch:<name>' rows carry last_ok_fetch.

TOKEN state_token READ

NODE state
SQL >
    SELECT 'eod' AS dataset, symbol AS key, toString(max(price_date)) AS last_date, '' AS last_ok_fetch
    FROM eod_prices
    GROUP BY symbol
    UNION ALL
    SELECT 'fx', concat(base_currency, '/', quote_currency), toString(max(rate_date)), ''
    FROM fx_rates
    GROUP BY base_currency, quote_currency
    UNION ALL
    SELECT concat('fetch:', dataset), symbol, '', toString(max(fetched_at))
    FROM fetch_log
    WHERE status IN ('ok', 'empty')
    GROUP BY dataset, symbol

TYPE endpoint
